---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import {brandComparisons,comparisonBrands,comparisonUrl,comparisonUpdated,renderComparisonText,scenarioMatches,scenarioPlanText,type BrandComparison} from '../../data/brand-comparisons';
import {planPriceText,planTrafficText} from '../../data/airports';
import {evidenceFor} from '../../data/evidence';
import {site} from '../../data/site';
export const getStaticPaths=()=>brandComparisons.map(item=>({params:{slug:item.slug},props:{item}}));
interface Props {item:BrandComparison}
const {item}=Astro.props;const brands=comparisonBrands(item);const charts=brands.map(b=>evidenceFor(b.slug));
const text=(value:string)=>renderComparisonText(value,item);
const index=brandComparisons.findIndex(p=>p.slug===item.slug);const next=brandComparisons[(index+1)%brandComparisons.length];const previous=brandComparisons[(index-1+brandComparisons.length)%brandComparisons.length];
const schema=[{'@type':'Article',headline:item.title,datePublished:comparisonUpdated,dateModified:comparisonUpdated,author:{'@type':'Organization',name:'航线笔记'},mainEntityOfPage:site.url+comparisonUrl(item)}];
---
<Base title={item.title} description={item.description} keywords={[brands[0].name+'对比'+brands[1].name,brands[0].name+'套餐',brands[1].name+'流量','机场品牌对照']} schema={schema} breadcrumbs={[{name:'品牌深度对照',url:'/comparisons/'},{name:brands.map(b=>b.name).join('与'),url:comparisonUrl(item)}]}>
 <header class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">BRAND COMPARISON / 深度对照</p><h1>{item.title}</h1><p>{item.lead}</p><p class="muted">分析更新：<time datetime={comparisonUpdated}>{comparisonUpdated}</time> · 参考套餐来源读取：{brands.map(b=>b.referenceChecked).filter((v,i,a)=>a.indexOf(v)===i).join('、')}</p></header>
 <nav class="comparison-sections" aria-label="对照阅读路径">{[['decision','先看判断'],['plans','价格与容量'],['scenarios','情景筛选'],['charts','读懂测速'],['checkout','付款前核对']].map(([id,label])=><a href={'#'+id}>{label}</a>)}</nav>
 <article class="reader-case comparison-article" data-deep-comparison={item.slug}>
  <section id="decision"><p class="eyebrow">THE DECISION</p><h2>{item.focus}</h2><p>{text(item.answer)}</p></section>
  <section id="plans"><h2>四档参考方案，保留原付款与额度口径</h2><div class="reader-table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="两家品牌套餐对照表，可横向滚动"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">品牌 / 套餐</th><th scope="col">参考价格</th><th scope="col">流量与发放</th><th scope="col">倍率 / 权益核对</th></tr></thead><tbody>{brands.flatMap(brand=>brand.plans.map((plan,index)=><tr data-comparison-plan={brand.slug+':'+index}><th scope="row"><a href={'/airport/'+brand.slug+'/#plans-heading'}>{brand.name}</a><br/>{plan.name}</th><td>{planPriceText(plan)}</td><td>{planTrafficText(plan)}</td><td>倍率：{plan.multiplier??'尚未核实'}<br/>{plan.note||'按所购档位分别核对'}</td></tr>))}</tbody></table></div><p>套餐表是来源资料整理，尚未核验商家当前结算。年付月均、明确月付和一次性总量分别保留；未知条件没有按免费、不限量或一倍处理。</p></section>
  <section aria-labelledby="comparison-analysis"><h2 id="comparison-analysis">决定之前，先读懂这三处差别</h2>{item.analysis.map(part=><div class="comparison-analysis"><h3>{part.title}</h3><p>{text(part.text)}</p></div>)}</section>
  <section id="scenarios"><h2>把条件放到同一档，再建立候选</h2><p><span class="case-example-label">编辑筛选情景 · 非真实用户账单</span></p><p>以下GB数值是已包含读者自留余量的假设计费预算，不再额外加成；未计入未经核验的优惠。月付情景不纳入年付折算或一次性包；总量情景只核对一份一次性额度，不预设叠加购买。</p><div class="reader-table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="三个条件情景与品牌档位匹配，可横向滚动"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">明确假设</th>{brands.map(b=><th scope="col">{b.name}</th>)}</tr></thead><tbody>{item.scenarios.map((scenario,i)=><tr data-comparison-scenario={i}><th scope="row">{scenario.title}<br/>{scenario.scope==='monthly'?'每月':'全部使用期间累计'} {scenario.quotaGB} GB<br/>{scenario.scope==='monthly'?'单月付款':'一份一次性包'}预算 ≤ CNY {scenario.budgetCny}</th>{brands.map(b=><td>{scenarioPlanText(scenarioMatches(b.plans,scenario))}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table></div><p>未匹配只表示本站当前收录的方案不符合这个情景，不能据此判断商家没有其他方案。满足容量和预算也不代表已经验证速度、平台资格或设备权限。</p><div class="case-reading"><a href={'/compare/?brands='+item.brands.join(',')}>将这两家带入自由比较 ⇄</a><a href="/tools/traffic-calculator/">计算自己的月度预算 →</a></div></section>
  <section><h2>不同需求，下一步看什么</h2><div class="comparison-choice-grid">{item.choices.map(choice=><div><h3>{choice.title}</h3><p>{text(choice.text)}</p></div>)}</div></section>
  <section id="charts"><h2>原始测速怎样支持这次选择</h2><p>{item.chartReading}</p><p>站长已确认本期全部图表使用同一测试环境，具体参数仍待补齐。两品牌的测试日期分别保留；没有把不同日期汇总为同一时点竞速排名。</p><div class="reader-table-scroll" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="原图时间与单位对照，可横向滚动"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">品牌</th><th scope="col">图示时间 / 样本</th><th scope="col">图示平均下载</th><th scope="col">图示平均TLS / HTTPS</th></tr></thead><tbody>{brands.map((brand,i)=>{const chart=charts[i];return chart?<tr data-comparison-chart={brand.slug}><th scope="row"><a href={'/airport/'+brand.slug+'/#performance-evidence'}>{brand.name}原图 ↗</a></th><td>{chart.time}<br/>{chart.nodeCount}个节点 · 时区未注明</td><td>{chart.averageDownloadMBps.toFixed(2)} MB/s</td><td>{chart.averageTlsMs.toFixed(1)} ms / {chart.averageHttpsMs.toFixed(1)} ms</td></tr>:<tr><th scope="row">{brand.name}</th><td colspan="3">尚未收录对应图表</td></tr>;})}</tbody></table></div><p class="fine-print">均值按图示节点等权统计；MB/s与Mbps不同。平台绿色计数是节点状态，非逐请求成功率；峰值、延迟、平台状态与长期稳定性分别判断。</p></section>
  <section id="checkout"><h2>付款前的三项具体核对</h2><ol class="comparison-checks">{item.checks.map(check=><li>{check}</li>)}</ol><div class="comparison-choice-grid">{brands.map(brand=><div><h3>{brand.name}优惠与结算</h3><p>{brand.coupon?<>已录入 <code>{brand.coupon.code}</code>，对应优惠价永久有效（站长确认）；具体折扣、适用档位及实际金额待结算凭据核对。</>:'本站未记录该品牌的站长优惠码，不据此判断商家一定没有活动。'}目前未公开结算凭据，不将参考标价写成实际实付。</p><a href={'/airport/'+brand.slug+'/#checkout-proof'}>核对本品牌凭据状态 →</a></div>)}</div></section>
  <section><h2>沿当前问题继续阅读</h2><div class="case-reading">{item.related.map(link=><a href={link.url}>{link.title} →</a>)}<a href="/troubleshooting/">故障排查中心 →</a><a href="/comparisons/">返回五组深度对照 →</a></div><p class="fine-print">本文解释现有资料和选择口径，不构成综合排名。品牌档案保留原资料入口及推广关系说明；本篇没有新增商家结算或连接测试。</p></section>
 </article>
 <nav class="article-pagination" aria-label="深度对照前后阅读"><a href={comparisonUrl(previous)}><span>← 上一篇对照</span><strong>{previous.title}</strong></a><a href={comparisonUrl(next)}><span>下一篇对照 →</span><strong>{next.title}</strong></a></nav>
</Base>
